  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Function notation, evaluating and composing functions, and reading the vertex of a parabola.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Functions",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\( f(a) \\) substitutes \\( a \\) for \\( x \\); a composite \\( f(g(x)) \\) works inside-out. In vertex form \\( y=a(x-h)^{2}+k \\), the vertex is \\( (h,k) \\) and the axis is \\( x=h \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Slide the vertex \\( (h,k) \\) of \\( y=(x-h)^{2}+k \\). The amber dot is the vertex; the dashed line is the axis of symmetry.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Vertex form",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvasId": "actFuncCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "A parabola in vertex form with adjustable vertex",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "actFuncDataBtn",
          "panelId": "actFuncDataPanel",
          "descId": "actFuncDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "actFuncDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Sampled points along the current parabola",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "y",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "actFuncH",
            "valueDisplayId": "actFuncHV",
            "label": {
              "en": "h (horizontal) =",
              "ar": null
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Horizontal shift h",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -4,
            "max": 4,
            "value": 0,
            "step": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "actFuncK",
            "valueDisplayId": "actFuncKV",
            "label": {
              "en": "k (vertical) =",
              "ar": null
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Vertical shift k",
              "ar": null
